abstract: >-
  LiGre, the Lemma Bank for Ancient Greek, publishes about 100,000 Ancient Greek
  lemmas as linked open data. Each lemma is an instance of the LiLa Lemma class
  with its written representations (OntoLex-Lemon), part of speech and, for
  nouns, gender, so that Ancient Greek corpora and lexical resources can be
  linked through their lemmas, following the conventions of the LiLa Knowledge
  Base for Latin.
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - lemma bank
  - lemmatization
  - linked open data
  - OntoLex-Lemon
  - LiLa
  - RDF
